WEBVTT

NOTE Timings measured off FILM04-audio-master-v5.mp3, not estimated.

1
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.700
Yeah.

2
00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:07.130
We hate Mondays.

3
00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:08.630
Tuesdays too.

4
00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:09.300
But…

5
00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.920
…what if it's your nervous system.

6
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.600
When our nervous systems are unregulated,

7
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.720
sometimes we're the last to find out.

8
00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:18.380
But everyone else around us can see it.

9
00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:20.450
By the time we realize it,

10
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:21.960
we've ruined another moment.

11
00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.160
That's why SafeRise is here.

12
00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:27.200
Our protocols help you harness Attention,

13
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.800
Awareness, and Authorship…

14
00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:33.200
…whether it's anger, anxiety, overwhelm,

15
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.420
resentment, or burnout.

16
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:38.300
Personal, in relationships, or at work.

17
00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:41.560
Built for the state you're actually in.

18
00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:45.500
We even have your physical substrates

19
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:49.160
covered…

20
00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:51.550
Because when you're overwhelmed…

21
00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:53.640
you don't want to be the last to find out.
